# The image installs PlatformIO and nothing else -- the project is bind-mounted
# at run time, not copied in. So the build context should be as close to empty
# as possible; everything here would only slow the build down.
#
# Credentials are listed too. They are already gitignored, and they must never
# end up baked into an image layer either.

.git/
.pio/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.vscode/

include/secrets.h
include/device_config.h
platformio_local.ini
tools/flasher/state.json

docs/
README.md
